    "bpp_uri": "https://krishikendra.bpp.uki.in",
    "transaction_id": "7e92a1d4-3fa2-48e7-944d-01a6c02fa98b",
    "message_id": "b2c4b58d-78d3-438e-b2bb-f6c5e4cbd99c",
    "timestamp": "2025-04-29T09:00:03Z"
  },
  "message": {
    "catalog": {
      "providers": [
        {
          "id": "krishikendra.bpp.uki.in",
          "descriptor": {
            "name": "Krishi Kendra Soil Services",
            "short_desc": "Comprehensive Soil Testing at your farm or lab"
          },
          "categories": [
            {
              "id": "soil-testing",
              "descriptor": {
                "name": "Soil Testing Services"
              }
            }
          ],
          "fulfillments": [
            {
              "id": "f1",
              "stops": [
                {
                  "type": "PickUp",
                  "location": {
                    "gps": "19.9975,73.7898",
                    "address": "Smita's Farm, Nashik"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "DropOff",
                  "location": {
                    "gps": "19.9910,73.7769",
                    "address": "Krishi Kendra Soil Lab, Nashik"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "soil-npk-test",
              "descriptor": {
                "name": "NPK Soil Test"
              },
              "price": {
                "currency": "INR",
                "value": "400.00"
              },
              "category_ids": [
                "soil-testing"
              ],
              "fulfillment_ids": [
                "f1"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "soil-ph-oc-test",
              "descriptor": {
                "name": "pH + Organic Carbon Test"
              },
              "price": {
                "currency": "INR",
                "value": "350.00"
              },
              "category_ids": [
                "soil-testing"
              ],
              "fulfillment_ids": [
                "f1"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
3. select
Purpose: The select API is used by Smita’s app (BAP) to indicate her selection of a specific service offering (item) and fulfillment type (pickup/drop-off) from a provider’s catalog. This is a declaration of intent to proceed toward booking the selected service. The BAP sends the selected item ID(s) along with the chosen fulfillment method and payment mode (e.g., cash on delivery) to the BPP. It does not yet create a final booking — it initiates a quote confirmation process where the BPP can validate and update availability, pricing, or terms.
Request Payload:
{
    "context": {
        "domain": "agri.uki",
        "action": "select",
        "version": "1.1.0",
        "location": {
            "city": {
                "code": "std:95253",
                "name": "Nashik"
            },
            "country": {
                "code": "IND",
                "name": "India"
            }
        },
        "bap_id": "soiltest.bap.uki.in",
        "bap_uri": "https://soiltest.bap.uki.in",
        "bpp_id": "krishikendra.bpp.uki.in",
        "bpp_uri": "https://krishikendra.bpp.uki.in",
        "transaction_id": "7e92a1d4-3fa2-48e7-944d-01a6c02fa98b",
        "message_id": "41a7eb31-09a4-4fc7-9845-8cb65cbdf13c",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-29T09:01:00Z"
    },
    "message": {
        "order": {
            "provider": {
                "id": "krishikendra.bpp.uki.in"
            },
            "items": [
                {
                    "id": "soil-npk-test"
                }
            ],
            "fulfillments": [
                {
                    "id": "f1"
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
4. on_select 
Purpose: The on_select callback is triggered by the BPP to respond to Smita’s selection. Here, the BPP confirms the availability of the selected service, provides the final quoted price (including any updated terms if needed), shares fulfillment details (such as pickup time slots), and optionally includes pre-requisite documents (e.g., soil sample collection instructions). This message allows the BAP to display the final offer to Smita before placing a confirmed order.
Response Payload:
