7. confirm
Purpose: The confirm API is sent by Smita's app (BAP) when she agrees to the final quoted price, fulfillment details, and terms shared by the BPP via on_select. By sending a confirm message, Smita formally places an order for the selected soil testing service. The order object inside the payload contains the provider ID, selected item(s), chosen fulfillment type, final payment details, and confirms the user's acceptance of the service. This triggers the actual booking process at the BPP's end.
Request Payload:
{
