8. on_confirm
Purpose: The on_confirm callback is triggered by the BPP to confirm that Smita's booking has been successfully created. It provides critical information such as the assigned agent details (e.g., phone number, arrival time), the order ID for future tracking, and any final updates to the fulfillment arrangement. Receiving this on_confirm message completes the booking cycle from an order placement perspective, and Smita can now await the service delivery.
Response Payload:
{
    "context": {
        "domain": "agri.uki",
        "action": "on_confirm",
        "version": "1.1.0",
        "location": {
            "city": {
                "code": "std:95253",
                "name": "Nashik"
            },
            "country": {
                "code": "IND",
                "name": "India"
