 9. status 
Purpose: The status API is invoked by Smita's app (BAP) to request the current fulfillment status of her confirmed soil testing order. It enables Smita to track whether the agent has collected the soil sample, whether testing is underway, or whether the final report is ready for download. This call queries the BPP with the previously issued order_id, and the BPP responds with a status update. It provides transparency and trust in the service flow, essential for user satisfaction.
Request Payload:


{
    "context": {
        "domain": "agri.uki",
        "action": "status",
        "version": "1.1.0",
        "location": {
            "city": {
                "code": "std:95253",
                "name": "Nashik"
            },
            "country": {
                "code": "IND",
                "name": "India"
            }
        },
        "bap_id": "soiltest.bap.uki.in",
