        "transaction_id": "7e92a1d4-3fa2-48e7-944d-01a6c02fa98b",
        "message_id": "e2e56f14-72fd-4cb5-b8c4-6e269ce87e68",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-29T09:01:03Z"
    },
    "message": {
        "order_id": "order-873652"
    }
}
10. on_status 
Purpose: The on_status API is triggered by the BPP in response to a status request. It provides real-time information on the current state of the order, like whether the agent has picked up the sample, whether testing is ongoing, or whether the final report is available for download.
