11. rating 
Purpose: After receiving the soil testing report, Smita can submit a rating for the service through the rating API. She gives a numeric score and may provide textual feedback regarding service quality, agent professionalism, and overall satisfaction. Ratings help improve the network by influencing provider reputations.
